0.47  2026-08-07
    - CA18 (EPIC-424): opt-in read-through cache, disabled by default.
      --cache-ttl N enables per call on read commands; entries key on
      the full argument set under the project workspace and stay valid
      only while the ttl and a hi-res board fingerprint both hold, so
      any write invalidates immediately. Hits report on stderr, corrupt
      entries warn and fall back live, cached conditional reads replay
      their exit status, --no-cache bypasses, misuse exits 2.

0.46  2026-08-07
    - CA14 (EPIC-424): -o json is now canonical compact JSON (stable
      key order, raw UTF-8, one line); -o json-pretty keeps the indented
      shape. Identical information, measurably smaller; the live
      dashboard /data payload shrinks with it. t/00's format contract
      updated deliberately with the owner-approved change.

0.45  2026-08-07
    - CA20 (EPIC-424): indexed reads on the append-only gate and
