      loud misses, --meta-only keeping results/uris/authors/stamps with
      text lengths and annotation counts, entry-level --where
      (result=fail), zero windows and --count as existence checks.
      Annotations ride with their entries; reads never mutate.

0.44  2026-08-07
    - CA13 (EPIC-424): first-class tira.diff. Since mode: added/changed
      kinds with current column, gate, title, new-comment ids, and now
      for chaining. Snapshot mode (a saved full export): per-field
      before/after for scalars, named new comments, explicit changed
      markers for structural fields, and added/changed/removed
      distinguished. Field scoping and --count compose; exactly one
      baseline; never writes. New cli/diff entrypoint (84 total).

0.43  2026-08-07
    - CA19 (EPIC-424): batch reads on show. Repeat --ref or pass --refs
      A,B,C; the response is {records, order, count} keyed by ref with
      request order kept and duplicates collapsed. Missing refs carry an
      explicit not_found marker without losing the call; validation
      fails whole and loud; 100-ref documented maximum; cross-type
      batches; --if-changed refused in favor of the hash-sweep poll.

0.42  2026-08-07
    - CA16 (EPIC-424): server-side --where filtering on list and export.
      Repeatable ANDed clauses: = equality, = empty meaning
      empty-or-unset, != both ways, ~ case-insensitive array containment
      (scalars never match, never crash). Computed fields filterable.
      Unknown fields and operatorless clauses exit 2. Composes with
      projection, count, and since.

